2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOUR WAYS TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from four unique Exo Suits, each with distinct movement styles, weapons, and abilities. It feels like playing four different games! Swap suits between missions to experiment with new ways to move and fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/110b5a81e5bdce14401979ba606d2cf6.poster.avif?t=1769179431\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/110b5a81e5bdce14401979ba606d2cf6.webm?t=1769179431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/110b5a81e5bdce14401979ba606d2cf6.mp4?t=1769179431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNT THE TITANS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face immense, world-shaping Titans that dominate the battlefield. Learn to read their attacks, stay mobile, and find creative openings to strike back. Defeating each Titan unlocks powerful upgrades and reveals more of the mystery behind their awakening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/cfc94d1844295d89779f4a6ad53b7f7d.poster.avif?t=1769179431\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/cfc94d1844295d89779f4a6ad53b7f7d.webm?t=1769179431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/cfc94d1844295d89779f4a6ad53b7f7d.mp4?t=1769179431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR IN CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your Titan-slaying skills in single player or in drop-in, drop-out co-op with up to four players. Missions, enemies, and rewards scale dynamically to match your team\u2019s size and coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/02439934e33cdfdc23533ca9ea83fb79.poster.avif?t=1769179431\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/02439934e33cdfdc23533ca9ea83fb79.webm?t=1769179431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/02439934e33cdfdc23533ca9ea83fb79.mp4?t=1769179431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT ACROSS A FRACTURED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the floating ruins of Titan Isles - from jungle canopies and molten caverns to storm-torn cliffs and frozen peaks. Each biome offers new traversal challenges, hidden rewards waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/3ca615982d1cd8d38e3db636e4e54612.poster.avif?t=1769179431\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/3ca615982d1cd8d38e3db636e4e54612.webm?t=1769179431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/3ca615982d1cd8d38e3db636e4e54612.mp4?t=1769179431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEST YOUR SPEED IN COMPETITIVE RACING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your Exo Suit skills to the test in racing minigames. Compete with friends &amp; players for the top of the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/2b85bfb9b9b3f7339431e02a526c4160.poster.avif?t=1769179431\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/2b85bfb9b9b3f7339431e02a526c4160.webm?t=1769179431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/extras/2b85bfb9b9b3f7339431e02a526c4160.mp4?t=1769179431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Psytec Games Ltd"],"dlc":[4054440],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839680/812ee094f43ee0fe2db3d7256c58ab693563d030/header.jpg?t=1769179431","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 0.1.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Steam Frame</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1839680/182431513/682bc31370ea72e35d28c42f1cc20929f4d52eb5/1760203421/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760208350","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1839680/182431513/682bc31370ea72e35d28c42f1cc20929f4d52eb5/1760203421/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760208350","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1839680/182431513/682bc31370ea72e35d28c42f1cc2092